Package: com.huayuarc.sneakycam
Name: SneakyCam 隐私相机
Description: Native SneakyCam capture build for iOS 15.0–17.4, Dopamine rootless and RootHide. 支持锁屏拍照/录像、录像声音、跨设备摄像头回退、会话中断恢复和多代音量键 API。视频或照片默认保存到系统相册，也可保存至 /var/mobile/Media/Camera。
Maintainer: Huayuarc
Author: Huayuarc,Spark
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), firmware (<= 17.4), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Version: 2.1.2
icon: https://huayuarc.github.io/icon/SneakyCam.png
